WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.100
A town of P people.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.150
One of them starts a rumour.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.330
The model says it spreads at a rate
proportional to the number who haven't heard

4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.950
it yet: P minus N.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.470
N counts the people who have heard.

6
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.080
As time passes, N climbs.

7
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:19.360
So what does the graph of
N against time look like?

8
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.210
Faster and faster for ever?

9
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.920
Or something else?

10
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:26.490
In this mission, you'll
turn words into maths.

11
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.120
Rate of change of N means d N by d t.

12
00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:35.590
Proportional to means equals k
times, with k a positive constant.

13
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.650
Put together, that's a
differential equation.

14
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.550
And you'll solve equations like
this by separating the variables.

15
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.870
Your mission: work out
how the rumour grows.
